	"rule.v_layup3":   ["VIOLATION · NO LAYUP (ROLE 3)", "INFRAZIONE · NIENTE TERZO TEMPO (RUOLO 3)"],
	"rule.v_layup3.body": ["Role 3 may never shoot on the run near the basket: no layups. Stop or pull up. Turnover.",
