	"rule.sub":        ["SUBSTITUTION", "SOSTITUZIONE"],
	"rule.sub.body":   ["A substitution is legal at any dead ball on request. The reserve comes in with the SAME ROLE as the man going out (the line-up must stay legal: two women on the floor, one pivot).",
