	"rule.v_pivot5s":  ["VIOLATION · PIVOT CLOCK", "INFRAZIONE · TEMPO DEL PIVOT"],
	"rule.v_pivot5s.body": ["The pivot (roles 1–2) must shoot within 10 seconds of the hand-off — 7 for a 2R. Turnover.",
