	"role.1":          ["ROLE 1 · PIVOT", "RUOLO 1 · PIVOT"],
	"role.1.d":        ["PIVOT in a wheelchair, never guarded. Ball handed to you INSIDE the area at the LOW side basket (1.20 m). First shot 3 pts, second 2. 10s to shoot.",
